  "text": "<h2 id=\"Early_life_and_education\">Early life and education</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Career\">Career</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Early_career\">Early career</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Junior_career\">Junior career</h3>\n<h4 id=\"2019–20_season:_Junior_international_debut\"><span id=\"2019.E2.80.9320_season:_Junior_international_debut\"></span>2019–20 season: Junior international debut</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2020–21_season\"><span id=\"2020.E2.80.9321_season\"></span>2020–21 season</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2021–22_season:_World_Junior_champion_and_two_Junior_Grand_Prix_gold\"><span id=\"2021.E2.80.9322_season:_World_Junior_champion_and_two_Junior_Grand_Prix_gold\"></span>2021–22 season: World Junior champion and two Junior Grand Prix gold</h4>\n<h3 id=\"Senior_career\">Senior career</h3>\n<h4 id=\"2021–22_season:_Senior_international_debut\"><span id=\"2021.E2.80.9322_season:_Senior_international_debut\"></span>2021–22 season: Senior international debut</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2022–23_season:_World_bronze_and_first_Grand_Prix_Final_medal\"><span id=\"2022.E2.80.9323_season:_World_bronze_and_first_Grand_Prix_Final_medal\"></span>2022–23 season: World bronze and first Grand Prix Final medal</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2023–24_season:_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold\"><span id=\"2023.E2.80.9324_season:_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold\"></span>2023–24 season: World champion and Grand Prix Final gold</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2024–25_season:_Second_consecutive_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold\"><span id=\"2024.E2.80.9325_season:_Second_consecutive_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold\"></span>2024–25 season: Second consecutive World champion and Grand Prix Final gold</h4>\n<h4 id=\"2025–26_season:_Milano_Cortina_Olympics_team_gold,_third_consecutive_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold,_new_world_record\"><span id=\"2025.E2.80.9326_season:_Milano_Cortina_Olympics_team_gold.2C_third_consecutive_World_champion_and_Grand_Prix_Final_gold.2C_new_world_record\"></span>2025–26 season: Milano Cortina Olympics team gold